      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=11)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Perception rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Perception Check), Performance rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Performance Check), Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
      **Senses** Passive Perception 12  
      **Languages** Common, Elvish, Sylvan  
      **Challenge** 1/2 (100 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Traits

      ***Magic Resistance.*** The satyr has ***Advantage*** on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.

      ## Actions

      ***Hooves.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Hooves]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d4+3,dicelabel=Damage [Hooves]) Bludgeoning damage. If the target is a Medium or smaller creature, the satyr pushes the target up to 10 feet straight away from itself.

      ***Mockery.*** *Wisdom Saving Throw:* DC 12, one creature the satyr can see within 90 feet. *Failure:* rollable(dice=1d6+2,dicelabel=Damage [Mockery]) Psychic damage.

